Output output/user_variables.mp4
Set FontSize 40
Set Width 1920
Set Height 1080
Set Padding 40
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 400ms
Set Shell bash

Hide
Type "./calcx"
Enter
Show

Sleep 2500ms

Type "my_var = 3"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "1+my_var^2"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "my_var = my_var+2"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "my_var"
Enter
Sleep 2s
